### Product Integration Test - Manual HTTP Testing

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@adminToken = <replace with actual admin token>
@supplierId = <replace with actual supplier ID>

### 1. Get All Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### 2. Get Product Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/stats

### 3. Get Low Stock Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/low-stock

### 4. Get Products by Category - Electronics
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/category/Electronics

### 5. Get Products by Category - Food
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/category/Food

### 6. Get Single Product
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}

### 7. Get Products by Supplier
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/supplier/{{supplierId}}

### 8. Create New Product
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Electronic Device",
  "sku": "SKU-PROD-{{$timestamp}}",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "current_stock": 100,
  "unit_price": 75000,
  "description": "A new electronic product",
  "supplier_id": "{{supplierId}}"
}

### 9. Create Product - Missing Required Field (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Incomplete Product",
  "sku": "SKU-INC"
}

### 10. Create Product - Without Auth (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Unauthorized Product",
  "sku": "SKU-UNAUTH",
  "category": "Test",
  "current_stock": 50,
  "unit_price": 25000,
  "supplier_id": "{{supplierId}}"
}

### Save Product ID for Further Tests
@productId = <replace with actual product ID from creation response>

### 11. Update Product
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Product Name",
  "unit_price": 80000,
  "description": "Updated description"
}

### 12. Update Product Stock
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current_stock": 150
}

### 13. Update Product Price
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}/price
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unit_price": 85000
}

### 14. Activate Product
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "is_active": true
}

### 15. Soft Delete Product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 16. Permanent Delete Product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}/permanent
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 17. Test Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=1&limit=10

### 18. Test Search/Filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?category=Electronics&min_price=50000&max_price=100000

### 19. Get Product with Batch Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}

### 20. Verify Deleted Product (Should Return 404 or Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{deletedProductId}}
